299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Dr. Nguyen Tuan Cuong is a lecturer in Information Systems and Data Sciences at Vietnamese-German University \(VGU\). He received his Ph.D. from Tokyo University of Agriculture and Technology \(TUAT\) in 2017. He had been an assistant professor at TUAT \(2017-2021\), an associate professor at the WACOM-TUAT joint research laboratory \(2022\), and a lecturer/researcher at FPT University \(2023\). He has been working on online and offline handwritten math/Japanese text/English text recognition, clustering and automatic scoring, co-organized VOHTR2018 competition on Vietnamese online handwriting recognition and CROHME2023 competition in recognizing handwritten mathematical expression.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [13]
>>
