<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Dr. Lam-Son Le \(Member, IEEE\) received his Ph.D. from the Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Lausanne \(EPFL\), Switzerland, in 2008. He spent four years as a Postdoctoral Researcher at the University of Wollongong, Australia. He currently holds dual roles at VGU: Academic Coordinator of the Bachelor's program in Computer Science and Lecturer in Software Engineering. His research interests include digital twins, decentralized computing, next-generation software architectures, and AI - driven business process management. Prior to joining VGU, he spent nine years at the Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology \(HCMUT\) - Vietnam National University, where he led a research group focused on data-driven enterprise software and processes. Lam-Son has successfully supervised three PhD students, served as program chair, demo track chair, publicity chair for various conferences in software engineering and enterprise computing. He has published around 70 papers in conference proceedings and journals.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [15]
>>
